	(property "Description" "Hirose FH34SRJ-12S-0.5SH(50) 0.5 mm FPC connector, 12 contacts, top and bottom contact, back-flip, 1.0 mm high (Hirose FH34SRJ catalog 2019-08, recommended PCB mounting pattern: signal pads 0.3x0.8 @0.5, B=5.5; tabs 0.4x0.8, E=7.1 / F=7.9; 3.3 from signal-pad outer edge to tab outer edge). Signal pads (rear, actuator side) at -Y; FPC opening at +Y. Viewed from the top with the opening at +Y, contact 1 is at +X. Pads 13/14 = mounting tabs."
